# Fictional EP Tracklist

## 1. Relay Twelve Holds Until the Bag Sags

**Story & Context:** The debut runs at 120 BPM. Nino opens on a low chiboni tonic-fifth relationship while Mara uses a rigid kick, clipped snare, and one-note mono sequence. During CHARGE the reed pair brightens and Mara adds two metallic auxiliary hits. HOLD stabilizes for eight bars with full sub pressure. As Nino enters SAG, one snare and every second sequencer note disappear, exposing the roughening reed beat. Tamar plays one prepared-Pianet suspended-second stab only when RESEAL begins. Giorgi replaces the next programmed rim with a dry doli stroke. Leonie enters with a low bass-clarinet fourth before the next CHARGE. In the final section, Nino deliberately prolongs SAG while Mara keeps the tempo unchanged but removes nearly half the machine layer, making acoustic weakness feel structurally powerful.

