## 3. Humidity Gauge Returns to Hold

**Story & Context:** The closer runs at 114 BPM and begins with the sparsest arrangement on the EP. Nino sustains long low chiboni tones while Mara uses only kick, one noise click, and short root sub every two bars. Tamar remains silent for the first minute. Giorgi plays one muted doli center hit at the end of each SAG. Leonie holds low bass-clarinet fundamentals through RESEAL, creating acoustic continuity while electronics withdraw. During the final minute, the pressure cycle gradually becomes more stable: SAG shortens, HOLD lengthens, and Mara allows the mono sequence to remain present longer each pass. The last phrase reaches a long even HOLD, then all electronics stop while the chiboni continues alone for several seconds before Nino releases the bag naturally.

